# The v1 ("MDR") wire protocol implemented here — payload opcodes, byte layouts
# and their meaning — was reverse engineered by the Gadgetbridge project
# (AGPL-3.0-or-later), with the message framing cross-checked against
# SonyHeadphonesClient (MIT). See README.md for the full attribution.
